- n) “Web Aggregator” for the purpose of these regulations is a person licensed by the Authority under these Regulations; 

- o) “Website” is a set of related web pages served from a single web domain. A website is hosted on at least one web server, accessible via a network such as the Internet or a private local area network through an Internet address known as a Uniform resource locator. The word “website” includes a web portal and/or a mobile site for the purpose of these regulations; 

- p) “Designated Website” for the purpose of these regulations is a website(s) with domain name(s) registered, owned by and used exclusively for the functions of the Web Aggregator; 

